{"articleNo":"2499","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2499&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"기초생활수급자 미래드림장학금 신청안내(2차)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.04.09","hit":"14959","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"550\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"52\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>기초생활수급자 미래드림장학금 신청안내(2차-기간연장)</strong></font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br>&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"545\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"538\" bgcolor=\"#ebe8e8\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"21\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>미래드림 장학금(기초생활수급자)</strong></font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"58\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"98\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>지원대상</strong></font></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"475\" height=\"98\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">- </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">신입생</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"> : 기초생활수급자 본인(2010년 대학에 입학한 신입생 중 기초생활수급자이면서&nbsp;&nbsp;아래 요건을 갖춘 자<br>- </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">재학생</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"> : 대학(교)에 재학(복학 포함)중인 기초생활수급자 중 </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">일정성적 및 학점요건을 충족</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">한 학부생</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"29\" height=\"131\" rowspan=\"2\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>1인당<br>지원금액</strong></font></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"24\" height=\"65\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>신입생</strong></font></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"475\" height=\"65\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">- 등록금 : 연 250만원(1학기 : 130만원, 2학기 : 120만원)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ ICL에서 생활비 연 200만원 지원</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"24\" height=\"66\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>재학생</strong></font></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"475\" height=\"66\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">- 등록금 : 연 450만원<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(1학기 : 230만원, 2학기 : 220만원)</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"29\" height=\"197\" rowspan=\"2\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>성적기준</strong></font></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"24\" height=\"131\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>신입생</strong></font></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"475\" height=\"131\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">- 고교내신이수과목 1/2이상 6등급 이내 또는 수능 영역<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(언어, 수리, 외국어, 기타) 중 2개 영역 이상 6등급 이내<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 기타 영역의 경우 2과목 이상의 성적이 6등급 이내인 경우 6등급 이내인 것으로 보며, 1개 과목만 응시한 경우에는 기타 영역의 성적이 없는 것으로 봄.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 언어, 수리, 외국어, 기타 영역 중 1개 영역만 응시한 경우 수능 성적으로 지원 불가</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"24\" height=\"65\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>재학생</strong></font></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"475\" height=\"65\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">직전학기 12학점, 80점(100점 만점기준-평균평점으로 환산시 2.6)이상</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"538\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"48\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: red; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">재학생은 장학금중에서 등록금 230만원 이나 등록금(130만원)+생활비(100만원)중 택 1 가능</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br>1. 신청기간 : </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: red; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">2010. 03. 22(월) - 05. 31(월)</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"> -기간연장 (추후 신청기간 없음)<br><br>2. 신청방법</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"> : 학자금대출포털사이트(</font></span><a href=\"http://www.studentloan.go.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">www.studentloan.go.kr</font></span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">) 에 회원 가입하여 온라인 신청<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 회원가입방법 : 예금거래은행 등을 방문하여 인터넷뱅킹가입 후 해당 은행 홈페이지에서 공인인증서 발급</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(미성년자는 발급절차 예금거래은행에 문의)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 회원 가입후 로그인→ 장학금 신청서 작성(본인정보 및 장학금 신청정보 입력 한 후 공인인증서를 이용하<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;여 본인인증 거치면 완료) → 신청서 등 관련서류 반드시 학생지원과로 제출<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: red; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">(반드시 서류를 제출하여야 신청 종료됨)<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 신청서 작성시 유의사항<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 반드시 학생명의로 기초생활수급자증명서를 발급 받는다.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② 가족관계는 본인의 부모를 기준(친권중심)으로 정확하게 입력 할 것<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 장학금 신청서에 학생이 입력한 자료를 기초로 장학금 대상자를 선발 하므로 오류입력에 따른 책임은<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;학생본인에게 있음.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;③ </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">수급자 정보는 발급받은 기초생활수급자 증빙서와 동일하게 작성</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">3. 서류제출(서류 제출 하여야 신청 종료 됨)<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 제 출 처 : 학생과(글로벌관 458호)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 제출서류<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 장학금신청서 1부.(온라인 신청 후 출력)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 기초생활수급자증명서 1부.(기 제출자는 생략)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">* 반드시 학생본인명의로 발급 받을 것<br><br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">4. 기타사항문의 : 054-478-7045<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;타장학금과 중복지원 불인정(단, 근로의 대가로 받는 장학금 예외)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>2010년 3월 31일<br><br>금오공과대학교 학생과장<br></strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
